@slanted_publishers has published its magazine on typography and visual culture since 2005. Each issue is built around a single theme, with a layout designed to match it.

@studio__play__ground is a biannual magazine that explores and questions Europe’s creative and cultural industries through essays, reports and honest conversations. 

@process__magazine is an independent print magazine from Kuala Lumpur about the creative process, speaking to people in art, music, design and architecture across Malaysia and Southeast Asia.

A biannual from Amsterdam. Every issue of @macguffinmagazine takes one ordinary, often anonymously designed object and follows the stories it sets in motion.

@type01_ uses typography as a starting point to talk about culture, business, technology, and design. 

@disegnojournal is a London journal of long-form writing and photography on design and the social forces that shape it.

@aestheticamag is a bi-monthly magazine on contemporary art and culture, featuring architects, artists, designers and photographers, from rising talents to established names.

The @stashmedia.tv Annual is a printed selection of motion design and animation projects curated from the Stash Permanent Collection. 

